{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_plan_archetypepostgeneratecomposer", "label": "ArchetypePostGenerateComposer.groovy", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces the 225-line bash pre-processor with roughly 50-80 lines of Groovy executed once per build in the process-resources phase; stateless \u2014 each build starts from zero and the result is packaged into the archetype jar."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_plan_bash_script_replacement", "label": "Replacement of bash_script/create_archetype_post_generate.sh", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The bash pre-processor (sed -i / tr / ls / read -n 1 -s) blocked TTY-independent CI and macOS/BSD-sed environments; native Groovy composition eliminates the bash dependency, and byte-equivalence with the historical output was the acceptance criterion of the migration."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_plan_groovy_maven_plugin", "label": "org.codehaus.gmaven:groovy-maven-plugin:2.1.1 (build-time Groovy execution)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_plan_imports_consolidation", "label": "Import consolidation (strip import lines, prepend body-01 prelude)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Byte-equivalence with the bash legacy requires removing pure and commented import lines from each snippet and prepending 